OL,4,G0230FThe Secret Diary of Adrian Mole,
OL,5,     FAged 13 3/4 (Omnibus)
OL,6,     GIt's 1981 and the year starts
OL,7,     Ginauspiciously for Adrian Mole. A
OL,8,     Gnew girl called Pandora joins his
OL,9,     Gclass. Read by Harry McEntire.
OL,10,G0340FInheritance Tracks
OL,11,     GActor Mark Heap chooses 'Were You
OL,12,     GThere?' by Tennessee Ernie Ford
OL,13,     Gand 'L'Ascension' composed by
OL,14,     GOlivier Messiaen.
OL,15,G0350FHigh Hopes (Omnibus)
OL,16,     GAnd in a packed programme, a
OL,17,     Gfuture comedy star is born
OL,18,     Gopposite a fire station. Ronnie
OL,19,     GCorbett reads from his
OL,20,     Gautobiography.
